  "text": "Pet Cancer Care - One Pet Cancer Care\nSkip to content\nAbout\nServices\nFor Owners\nFor Vets\nContact us today\nContact us today\nPet Cancer Care\nPet Cancer Care\nPet Cancer Care\nDevAccount\n2023-05-24T02:33:10+10:00\nPet Cancer Care\nWe know that your pet is a member of your family, and receiving a cancer diagnosis can be very difficult.\nWe want you to know that there is\nhope\n.\nWe want to make it as easy as possible for you to\naccess\nexperts with the best current knowledge, and access to state of the art technology and techniques, and to know that you are giving your pet the best chance of a comfortable and happy life.\nYour local vet, who has been caring for your loved pet through their life, can\nconnect\nyou with the team of cancer specialists with just one referral.\nWe will work with you and your regular vet to provide you with all the\ncare\nand\nexpertise\nyou need to make the most appropriate decision that works for you, your family and your pet.\nWe are here to help.\nOther Services\nView all services\nMedical Oncology\nLearn more\nRadiation Oncology\nLearn more\nSurgical Oncology\nLearn more\n1800 111 738\ninfo@onepetcancercare.com\nQuick Links\nAbout\nServices\nFor Owners\nFor Vets\nCase studies\nFAQs\nCareers\nContact\nServices\nPet Cancer Care\nSurgical Oncology\nRadiation Oncology\nMedical Oncology\nLocations\nNorth Shore Vet – Sydney\nConcord – Sydney\nPet Specialists – Sydney\nBVSC – Brisbane\n© All rights reserved. •\nTerms of Use\n•\nPrivacy Policy\n• ONE – Cancer Care for Pets\nPage load link\nWe want you to know that there is\nhope\n.\nAbout\nServices\nFor Owners\nFor Vets\nNorth Shore Veterinary Hospital\n63 Herbert St Artarmon NSW 2064\n02 7252 1411\ninfo@onepetcancercare.com\nBrisbane Veterinary Specialist Centre\n53 Old Northern Rd Albany Creek QLD 4035\n07 3264 9400\ninfo@bvsc.com.au\nThe Pet Specialists\n16 Myoora Rd Terrey Hills NSW 2084\n02 7252 1411 / 1800 111 738\ninfo@onepetcancercare.com\nONE Cancer Care for Pets 